{"audio": "matthew-07.opus", "voice": "Davis", "duration_ms": 196133, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 1733, "text": "Matthew, Chapter Seven."}, {"start_ms": 1733, "end_ms": 4133, "text": "Judge not, that ye be not judged."}, {"start_ms": 4133, "end_ms": 10667, "text": "For with what judgment ye judge, ye shall be judged: and with what measure ye mete, it shall be measured to you again."}, {"start_ms": 10667, "end_ms": 17067, "text": "And why beholdest thou the mote that is in thy brother's eye, but considerest not the beam that is in thine own eye?"}, {"start_ms": 17067, "end_ms": 25333, "text": "Or how wilt thou say to thy brother, Let me pull out the mote out of thine eye; and, behold, a beam is in thine own eye?"}, {"start_ms": 25333, "end_ms": 33333, "text": "Thou hypocrite, first cast out the beam out of thine own eye; and then shalt thou see clearly to cast out the mote out of thy brother's eye."}, {"start_ms": 33333, "end_ms": 43333, "text": "Give not that which is holy unto the dogs, neither cast ye your pearls before swine, lest they trample them under their feet, and turn again and rend you."}, {"start_ms": 43333, "end_ms": 55067, "text": "Ask, and it shall be given you; seek, and ye shall find; knock, and it shall be opened unto you: For every one that asketh receiveth; and he that seeketh findeth; and to him that knocketh it shall be opened."}, {"start_ms": 55067, "end_ms": 60533, "text": "Or what man is there of you, whom if his son ask bread, will he give him a stone?"}, {"start_ms": 60533, "end_ms": 62933, "text": "Or if he ask a fish, will he give him a serpent?"}, {"start_ms": 62933, "end_ms": 72533, "text": "If ye then, being evil, know how to give good gifts unto your children, how much more shall your Father which is in heaven give good things to them that ask him?"}, {"start_ms": 72533, "end_ms": 80667, "text": "Therefore all things whatsoever ye would that men should do to you, do ye even so to them: for this is the law and the prophets."}, {"start_ms": 80667, "end_ms": 95333, "text": "Enter ye in at the strait gate: for wide is the gate, and broad is the way, that leadeth to destruction, and many there be which go in thereat: Because strait is the gate, and narrow is the way, which leadeth unto life, and few there be that find it."}, {"start_ms": 95333, "end_ms": 100933, "text": "Beware of false prophets, which come to you in sheep's clothing, but inwardly they are ravening wolves."}, {"start_ms": 100933, "end_ms": 103733, "text": "Ye shall know them by their fruits."}, {"start_ms": 103733, "end_ms": 107467, "text": "Do men gather grapes of thorns, or figs of thistles?"}, {"start_ms": 107467, "end_ms": 113467, "text": "Even so every good tree bringeth forth good fruit; but a corrupt tree bringeth forth evil fruit."}, {"start_ms": 113467, "end_ms": 119333, "text": "A good tree cannot bring forth evil fruit, neither can a corrupt tree bring forth good fruit."}, {"start_ms": 119333, "end_ms": 124667, "text": "Every tree that bringeth not forth good fruit is hewn down, and cast into the fire."}, {"start_ms": 124667, "end_ms": 127467, "text": "Wherefore by their fruits ye shall know them."}, {"start_ms": 127467, "end_ms": 136000, "text": "Not every one that saith unto me, Lord, Lord, shall enter into the kingdom of heaven; but he that doeth the will of my Father which is in heaven."}, {"start_ms": 136000, "end_ms": 142133, "text": "Many will say to me in that day, Lord, Lord, have we not prophesied in thy name?"}, {"start_ms": 142133, "end_ms": 144933, "text": "and in thy name have cast out devils?"}, {"start_ms": 144933, "end_ms": 147333, "text": "and in thy name done many wonderful works?"}, {"start_ms": 147333, "end_ms": 153600, "text": "And then will I profess unto them, I never knew you: depart from me, ye that work iniquity."}, {"start_ms": 153600, "end_ms": 170133, "text": "Therefore whosoever heareth these sayings of mine, and doeth them, I will liken him unto a wise man, which built his house upon a rock: And the rain descended, and the floods came, and the winds blew, and beat upon that house; and it fell not: for it was founded upon a rock."}, {"start_ms": 170133, "end_ms": 186667, "text": "And every one that heareth these sayings of mine, and doeth them not, shall be likened unto a foolish man, which built his house upon the sand: And the rain descended, and the floods came, and the winds blew, and beat upon that house; and it fell: and great was the fall of it."}, {"start_ms": 186667, "end_ms": 196133, "text": "And it came to pass, when Jesus had ended these sayings, the people were astonished at his doctrine: For he taught them as one having authority, and not as the scribes."}], "words": [{"t": "Matthew,", "s": 222, "e": 645, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 887, "e": 1270, "si": 0}, {"t": "Seven.", "s": 1330, "e": 1632, "si": 0}, {"t": "Judge", "s": 2318, "e": 2600, "si": 1}, {"t": "not,", "s": 2661, "e": 2923, "si": 1}, {"t": "that", "s": 2983, "e": 3125, "si": 1}, {"t": "ye", "s": 3165, "e": 3225, "si": 1}, {"t": "be", "s": 3306, "e": 3367, "si": 1}, {"t": "not", "s": 3447, "e": 3609, "si": 1}, {"t": "judged.", "s": 3689, "e": 4113, "si": 1}, {"t": "For", "s": 4634, "e": 4754, "si": 2}, {"t": "with", "s": 4794, "e": 4935, "si": 2}, {"t": "what", "s": 4955, "e": 5095, "si": 2}, {"t": "judgment", "s": 5175, "e": 5596, "si": 2}, {"t": "ye", "s": 5636, "e": 5696, "si": 2}, {"t": "judge,", "s": 5797, "e": 6137, "si": 2}, {"t": "ye", "s": 6177, "e": 6238, "si": 2}, {"t": "shall", "s": 6298, "e": 6478, "si": 2}, {"t": "be", "s": 6498, "e": 6558, "si": 2}, {"t": "judged:", "s": 6638, "e": 7079, "si": 2}, {"t": "and", "s": 7600, "e": 7681, "si": 2}, {"t": "with", "s": 7701, "e": 7821, "si": 2}, {"t": "what", "s": 7841, "e": 7981, "si": 2}, {"t": "measure", "s": 8102, "e": 8422, "si": 2}, {"t": "ye", "s": 8482, "e": 8562, "si": 2}, {"t": "mete,", "s": 8683, "e": 8943, "si": 2}, {"t": "it", "s": 9064, "e": 9144, "si": 2}, {"t": "shall", "s": 9184, "e": 934